{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your villagers and defeat the ultimate evil! Valiant Villagers is a roguelike strategy RPG where your choices determine your army's abilities and playstyle as you complete various map objectives. Pick two of your villagers' initial classes and embark on an adventure as you try to complete 5 maps in a row without your army being defeated.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>RANDOMIZED ELEMENTS!</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588050/extras/63b68270ae49124623cb6468fb118324.poster.avif?t=1756508680\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588050/extras/63b68270ae49124623cb6468fb118324.webm?t=1756508680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588050/extras/63b68270ae49124623cb6468fb118324.mp4?t=1756508680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With randomized maps, skills and classes, no attempts is the same. Experiment with different builds and possibilities to suit your own playstyle! Moreover, when you level up your stat gains are determined at random based on chances set by your unit's class, and these values can be modified if you use the right skills!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>BUILD AN ARMY!</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588050/extras/5d83f9308b326e4985b22721695372fb.poster.avif?t=1756508680\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588050/extras/5d83f9308b326e4985b22721695372fb.webm?t=1756508680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588050/extras/5d83f9308b326e4985b22721695372fb.mp4?t=1756508680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With multiple class trees and class skills you will be able to try different army builds and synergies! Experiment with classes and find combos that will help you and your villagers achieve victory!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>DIFFERENT MAP OBJECTIVES!</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588050/extras/2f77e865ee7a4213409e258539e702e7.poster.avif?t=1756508680\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588050/extras/2f77e865ee7a4213409e258539e702e7.webm?t=1756508680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588050/extras/2f77e865ee7a4213409e258539e702e7.mp4?t=1756508680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay on your toes! Not every map requires you to do the same thing! with objectives like defend, escape, beat boss and rout the enemy, adaptability is the key to success!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3588050?t=1756508680","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3588050?t=1756508680","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588050/6ebff04174608381601b7b231d547adfff8b4a27/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756508680","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588050/6ebff0417